{"login": "MarcoKouyate", "location": "Paris", "commits": [{"sha": "518c9fe460cfa549231a17a29560fb4f9c433728", "message": "RENDU AU PROF\n\nVoici la version rendu au prof.\nCertains bugs persistent, comme les petits slims qui traversent le sol\nou l'abeille qui fuit le joueur.", "created_at": "2016-04-27T11:53:39Z", "repo": "MatthewGame", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "639e38cecd3715a0fad8af5e58018dd3e7936aa7", "message": "Yoyo de combat\n\nLe yoyo peut attaquer!\nMatthew r\u00e9agit quand on le frappe !\nL'abeille aussi ! Elle explose quand elle meurt !\nProbl\u00e8me de distance du yoyo r\u00e9gl\u00e9 !\n\nIl manque juste qu'\u00e0 int\u00e9grer le slim et l'animation de nage (j'ai\ncapt\u00e9 comment faire)", "created_at": "2016-04-26T02:27:22Z", "repo": "MatthewGame", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "102da2cfb18af4b3b684f2274d4c9113b6d7ce20", "message": "Commit de derni\u00e8re minute\n\nPour que tu puisses y int\u00e9grer les ennemis correctement, parce que l\u00e0\nje comprends pas x)", "created_at": "2016-04-25T11:24:35Z", "repo": "MatthewGame", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f6c3a7c2f8650f3b00deff606e4c194d3cdd91a7", "message": "Yoyo - Edit\n\nJe n'ai pas r\u00e9ussi \u00e0 faire ricocher le yoyo, mais j'essaye qu'au moins\non ne puisse plus traverser les murs", "created_at": "2016-04-24T18:35:00Z", "repo": "MatthewGame", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7d59eaf85ea45f4aa74c9b033c712dd41d2661eb", "message": "Le yoyo fonctionne\n\nVoil\u00e0", "created_at": "2016-03-14T23:46:30Z", "repo": "MatthewGame", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fc05ce81b347f3def2745bd9c8d5e4da3bd6ef38", "message": "updated dll", "created_at": "2016-02-29T15:05:46Z", "repo": "MatthewGame", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": nul